# Keep GitHub's language bar honest.
# Jupyter notebooks are huge (embedded outputs and images), so they would otherwise
# make the repository show up as ~100% "Jupyter Notebook" and hide the PHP, Python,
# JavaScript, HTML and CSS code. Exclude them from the language statistics.
*.ipynb linguist-vendored

# Third-party demo (SMART-pred) - not my own code, so keep it out of the statistics too.
"Rstudio projects/**" linguist-vendored
